<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/9/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If no general meeting is convened within the time specified in subsection (1), the Registrar- General may amend the by-laws of the registered society on his own motion and any amendment made shall be deemed to be a registered amendment under section 18.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/9/eng@> .
